{
  "name": "AgendaMagno · Entregar respostas",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "68f79707-50c0-493d-b40c-9f5f092e9360",
      "name": "Como configurar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -170
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 710,
        "height": 210,
        "content": "## AgendaMagno · Entregar respostas\n1. Em Configuração, informe a URL interna da aplicação (Docker: http://app:3000).\n2. No HTTP Request, selecione a credencial Header Auth **AgendaMagno API**: nome Authorization; valor Bearer <INTERNAL_API_TOKEN>.\nSalve e ative o workflow. Horários em America/Bahia. Nenhum segredo está neste arquivo.\nA API valida, persiste e deduplica. Não ligue o webhook WAHA diretamente a este fluxo."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2381947a-75a0-48b0-97f5-516b6cf0b273",
      "name": "Agendamento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2a41b1ee-f0f5-4a9e-ae95-c95a3e831832",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bbd0455b-e048-421a-a68c-cdf159b00c88",
              "name": "appUrl",
              "value": "http://app:3000",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "779462d6-d72b-48d6-9646-22d1669885ff",
      "name": "Executar na API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.appUrl + '/api/internal/dispatch' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CONFIGURAR_CREDENCIAL_API",
          "name": "AgendaMagno API"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1500
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1f92cc-1ced-46a1-b63d-5ae989e37eb1",
      "name": "Há mais trabalho?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
